[I] Official command line interface for the DigitalOcean API

[T] doctl is a command-line interface (CLI) for the DigitalOcean API.

[U] https://github.com/digitalocean/doctl

[A] Doctl Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS
[R] + arm arm64 loongarch64 mips mips64 powerpc64 riscv64 s390x x86 x86-64

[L] APL
[V] 2.1.0

[D] 076ba1fdd54012e1adc73e1036961f3b595698ed9dc6b68851371e54 doctl-2.1.0.tar.gz https://github.com/digitalocean/doctl/archive/v2.1.0/

. $base/package/*/*/go-conf.in

var_append goconfopt ' ' '-o doctl ./cmd/doctl'
hook_add postmake 5 'cp -vf doctl $root$bindir/'
